If you have people in your life that will tell you the honest truth, really regard them and understand that the honest truth does not always have to be characterized as negative.

2
00:00:12,670 --> 00:00:24,070
You do yourself a very real disservice when you consider somebody giving you insight with the intent of informing as someone being negative.

3
